== ADR-0010: `1..N(2)` is now a call of N. N is a value, so the analyzer
== explains how the step is written.
Module Diagnostics.ForOldStepGluedValue

Main :
    N := 10
    for I in 1..N(2)
        PutLn(I)
    ;
;